<div class="modal-content">
    <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <h4 class="modal-title">Buyer Screen Help</h4>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">

        <h2> How to modify the Column View</h2>
        <p class="help-text">From the dashboard, you should be in the Purchasing WIP view as shown below:</p>

        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/buyer-1.jpg" />

        <p class="help-text">Find the procedure name column:</p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/buyer-2.jpg" />


        <p class="help-text"> Click on the colum icon as shown below:</p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/buyer-3.jpg" />

        <p class="help-text">The following drop down menu will appear;</p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/buyer-4.jpg"  />


        <p class="help-text">
            Check and unckeck columns to modify the view as needed: 
        </p>
        <img class="help-img" src="~/assets/help/buyer-5.jpg"  />
        <div class="alert alert-warning help-alert alert-dismissible">
            <a href="#" class="close" data-dismiss="alert" aria-label="close">&times;</a>
            <i class="fa fa-warning"></i> Please note, you will not be able to modify the <em>Procedure Name</em> column.
        </div>

        <p class="help-text">
            After you modify your columns, you can scroll side to side or up and down depending on how many work orders were generated.
        </p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/buyer-6.jpg" />


        <p class="help-text">To reset your view, please navigate back to your dashboard: </p>
        <img class="help-img" src="/assets/help/buyer-7.jpg"  />

        <div class="alert alert-info help-alert alert-dismissible">
            <a href="#" class="close" data-dismiss="alert" aria-label="close">&times;</a>
            <i class="fa fa-info"></i>If you need additional assistance or have questions, please email support at <a href="mailto:answer-support@msr-fsr.com">answer-support@msr-fsr.com</a> <span class="hidden-print">or open a ticket using the button below</span>.
        </div>

    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary pull-left" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#supportModal"><i class="fa fa-life-bouy"></i> Open Ticket</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" onclick="js:window.print()"><i class="fa fa-print"></i> Print Help</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-warning" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-close-o"></i> Close</button>
    </div>
</div>

